    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotem is a unique and challenging tile puzzle game featuring three distinct puzzle modes: Tile Rotator, Tile Swapper, and Rotem Puzzle. With 240 themed images, 20 ambient music tracks, and a variety of difficulty levels, test your logic and problem-solving skills as you rotate, swap, and arrange tiles to complete beautiful images!</p>",
